  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sudan Emergency Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sudan is on the brink of civil war, as a violent clash for power threatens the lives of people in the country. Hundreds of Sudanese have been killed and many more injured in fighting that erupted in April 2023. People are fleeing the capital Khartoum and conflict-plagued Darfur region due to violence and limited access to food, water, and healthcare. Your donation to the Sudan Emergency Fund will provide emergency relief, food, water, medicine, and other essential supplies to people in need.</narrative>
  </description>
